    "reviews": "\u201c...an overture to interactive cinema, lavishly staged and theatrically presented...its rich musical score is undergirded by a dramatic and eerie story!\u201d<br />\r\nComputer Gaming World<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cFeel the excitement as you try to solve one of the most intriguing mysteries ever! Make sure you don\u2019t miss this one!\u201d<br />\r\nComputer Game Review<br />\r\n",
